  "title": "primalucelib refused SESTO SENSO 3 ARCO moves and syncs it had acknowledged",
  "description": "The SESTO SENSO 3 (firmware 1.0.9) acknowledges MOT2 MOVE_ABS and SYNC_POS under MOT2.DEG; the library read only MOT2.STEP and MOT2.SYNC_POS, so the ARCO moved while ROTATOR_POSITION went ALERT at once, and syncs failed.\n\nImported from .factory/findings/archive/FND-20261023080442-7930-primaluce-arco-sestosenso3-001.json (category: functional, blocking: no).",
